2026-07-27T08:22:58.8651723Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:22:58.8652477Z i /tmp/RtmpH0lbsp/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:22:58.8652972Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:22:58.8653596Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:22:58.8654518Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:22:58.8655417Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:22:58.8656974Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:22:58.8657889Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:22:58.8924799Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:22:58.9041573Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:22:58.9507292Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:22:58.9683426Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
